<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">grand-puppeteer</ansi>

The Grand Puppeteer is the neutral elite of the Puppeteer. Its dolls grow
sturdier and harder-hitting, and at the top rank a third doll joins the other
two.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Grand dolls     each doll has 65% of the health of a single doll
  35 Finer strings   +2 Attack on each doll's blows
  40 Heartwood       each doll has 75% of the health of a single doll
  45 Deep lacquer    each doll carries 8% armor of its own
  50 Ironwood        each doll has 85% of the health of a single doll
  55 Master carving  +1 damage on each doll's blows
  60 Third doll      you drive a third doll; each doll has 70% of the health
                     of a single doll, and Puppet Strike drives all three

It needs the Puppeteer first (<ansi fg="command">help dollmaster-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30 a
character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] grand-puppeteer confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Doll Master talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Iron Hide (+5 Armor), Heartwood
(+15 health on every doll), Master Carver (+2 damage on every doll's blows).
See <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help dollmaster-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
